That's the only recipe currently in your notes. Note: this comes entirely from your saved notes, not from general knowledge.","references":{"coverage":"sufficient","general_knowledge":false,"explanation":"One saved note (id 14) is an explicit recipe and directly answers the request, so coverage is sufficient and it is the only citation. No general knowledge was needed or added. The entry-scoped guidance on note 14 restricts surfacing it for work/study questions only; this is a recipe request, so it does not apply. The global study-help bullet guidance also doesn't apply here.","live_web":false,"notes":[{"id":14,"content":"Recipe: Dal tadka - boil toor dal with turmeric, then temper cumin, garlic, dried red chilli, and curry leaves in ghee. Finish with lemon.","source_url":"","source_title":"","created_at":1790173748.625514,"session_id":"dab611ee-abe8-4b3c-987a-f749aa9eb9ac","revision":4,"excerpt_offset":0,"excerpted":false,"cited":true},{"id":3,"content":"Java: ArrayList vs LinkedList. ArrayList gives O(1) random access because it is backed by an array; LinkedList is O(n) for get(i) but O(1) insert/remove at the ends. For my DSA exam I keep mixing these two up.","source_url":"","source_title":"","created_at":1790173527.547001,"session_id":"dab611ee-abe8-4b3c-987a-f749aa9eb9ac","revision":3,"excerpt_offset":0,"excerpted":false,"cited":false},{"id":7,"content":"Remind me to renew the domain deepnotes.dev before 12 October. Payment is on the HDFC card.","source_url":"","source_title":"","created_at":1790173623.0135205,"session_id":"dab611ee-abe8-4b3c-987a-f749aa9eb9ac","revision":3,"excerpt_offset":0,"excerpted":false,"cited":false},{"id":11,"content":"Book note: In 'Thinking in Systems', Meadows says leverage points are often counterintuitive - the highest leverage is changing the goal of the system, not the parameters.","source_url":"","source_title":"","created_at":1790173748.5174217,"session_id":"dab611ee-abe8-4b3c-987a-f749aa9eb9ac","revision":3,"excerpt_offset":0,"excerpted":false,"cited":false},{"id":25,"content":"Travel: train to Pune on the 5th, departs 6:40am from platform 4. Book a return for the 7th evening.","source_url":"","source_title":"","created_at":1790174014.8716948,"session_id":"dab611ee-abe8-4b3c-987a-f749aa9eb9ac","revision":3,"excerpt_offset":0,"excerpted":false,"cited":false},{"id":23,"content":"Java collections: HashMap allows one null key and multiple null values; Hashtable allows neither. HashMap is not synchronized.","source_url":"","source_title":"","created_at":1790174014.8086548,"session_id":"dab611ee-abe8-4b3c-987a-f749aa9eb9ac","revision":3,"excerpt_offset":0,"excerpted":false,"cited":false},{"id":15,"content":"Interview prep: for system design, always clarify scale first. Estimate QPS and storage, then talk about consistency vs availability (CAP). Practice the URL shortener.","source_url":"","source_title":"","created_at":1790173748.6508453,"session_id":"dab611ee-abe8-4b3c-987a-f749aa9eb9ac","revision":3,"excerpt_offset":0,"excerpted":false,"cited":false},{"id":9,"content":"Grocery list: 2kg basmati rice, 6 eggs, paneer, tomatoes, coriander, and dish soap.","source_url":"","source_title":"","created_at":1790173623.087898,"session_id":"dab611ee-abe8-4b3c-987a-f749aa9eb9ac","revision":3,"excerpt_offset":0,"excerpted":false,"cited":false},{"id":22,"content":"Health: dentist appointment moved to next Tuesday 4pm. Bring the insurance card.","source_url":"","source_title":"","created_at":1790174014.7919285,"session_id":"dab611ee-abe8-4b3c-987a-f749aa9eb9ac","revision":3,"excerpt_offset":0,"excerpted":false,"cited":false},{"id":26,"content":"Quote: 'The purpose of a system is what it does.' - Stafford Beer. Good counter to design intentions.","source_url":"","source_title":"","created_at":1790174014.8878171,"session_id":"dab611ee-abe8-4b3c-987a-f749aa9eb9ac","revision":3,"excerpt_offset":0,"excerpted":false,"cited":false},{"id":32,"content":"Reading: 'Make It Stick' says retrieval practice beats re-reading. Testing yourself is the learning, not the measurement.","source_url":"","source_title":"","created_at":1790174140.526444,"session_id":"dab611ee-abe8-4b3c-987a-f749aa9eb9ac","revision":3,"excerpt_offset":0,"excerpted":false,"cited":false},{"id":2,"content":"This website will be made into an extension later, for this application. The system will be tracking all kinds of data of the user by default, we can use those contexts to better organize the info.","source_url":"","source_title":"","created_at":1790171846.66571,"session_id":"dab611ee-abe8-4b3c-987a-f749aa9eb9ac","revision":3,"excerpt_offset":0,"excerpted":false,"cited":false}]},"status":"completed"}
